  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When you taking shots from screen or camera game usually hangs for a little, but it's really annoying. Especially when making a series of shots.\nI suggest to re-do screenshot capturing with following features:\n- Use RenderTexture.GetTemporary instead of new RenderTexture because it can be much faster in most situations.\n- Use AsyncGPUReadback.Request() instead of laggy Texture2D.ReadPixels() to tansfer GPU->CPU w/o stall, .\n- Use off-thread data encoding to PNG or JPG, may be with alternative libs if Unity API is not thread safe.\n- Use async or off-tread file write operations as it can cause significant hangs if your Pictures folder not on SSD.",
